{"chunk_id":"vidalia.profile.v2","text":"維達利亞是鳴霖的初代精靈與平衡議會調解人，也是守護命脈之泉的史官。她重視自然秩序、證據與平衡。","npc_ids":["vidalia"],"session_id":null,"visibility":"public","knowledge_type":"character_profile","unlock_condition":"always","available_from_turn":0,"canon_version":2,"source_id":"frontend-character-profile","source_locator":"backend/content/characters.py#vidalia","epistemic_status":"confirmed","keywords":["維達利亞","平衡議會","命脈之泉","史官","調解人"]}
{"chunk_id":"vidalia.life_spring.v2","text":"目前可確認的是命脈之泉已很久沒有向外延伸，最近又出現異象；兩者是否相關、異象的確切症狀與成因都尚未確認。","npc_ids":["vidalia"],"session_id":null,"visibility":"public","knowledge_type":"world_state","unlock_condition":"always","available_from_turn":0,"canon_version":2,"source_id":"preset-npc-dialogue","source_locator":"backend/content/npc_dialogue.py#vidalia_ask_spring","epistemic_status":"confirmed","keywords":["命脈之泉","泉水","異象","停止延伸","成因"]}
{"chunk_id":"vidalia.investigation.v2","text":"調查命脈之泉時，應先在岸邊查探灰燼與裂響，記下親眼確認的痕跡，再依證據比對；不能先宣稱症狀或原因已成立。","npc_ids":["vidalia"],"session_id":null,"visibility":"public","knowledge_type":"investigation_method","unlock_condition":"always","available_from_turn":0,"canon_version":2,"source_id":"preset-npc-dialogue","source_locator":"backend/content/npc_dialogue.py#vidalia_ask_inspection","epistemic_status":"confirmed","keywords":["命脈之泉","調查","灰燼","裂響","證據","原因"]}
{"chunk_id":"menmesvento.profile.v2","text":"門梅司文托是流塵谷隱者與古卷守護者，記錄願意留下的名字、記憶與可證實的往事；他的語氣沉穩而莊重。","npc_ids":["menmesvento"],"session_id":null,"visibility":"public","knowledge_type":"character_profile","unlock_condition":"always","available_from_turn":0,"canon_version":2,"source_id":"frontend-character-profile","source_locator":"backend/content/characters.py#menmesvento","epistemic_status":"confirmed","keywords":["門梅司文托","流塵谷","古卷","名字","記憶","守護者"]}
{"chunk_id":"menmesvento.names.v2","text":"流塵谷的風很快會抹去足跡；有些人只希望自己的名字仍有人願意聽見。門梅司文托會先聽取當事人的名字與見證，不替他們編造歷史。","npc_ids":["menmesvento"],"session_id":null,"visibility":"public","knowledge_type":"local_custom","unlock_condition":"always","available_from_turn":0,"canon_version":2,"source_id":"preset-npc-dialogue","source_locator":"backend/content/npc_dialogue.py#menmesvento_ask_names","epistemic_status":"confirmed","keywords":["流塵谷","名字","記住","見證","風沙","歷史"]}
{"chunk_id":"menmesvento.scroll.v2","text":"目前只確認門梅司文托用古卷記下願意留下的名字與親眼可證的往事。古卷的完整內容、超自然能力、危險與觸碰後果均沒有可核實設定。","npc_ids":["menmesvento"],"session_id":null,"visibility":"public","knowledge_type":"item_knowledge","unlock_condition":"always","available_from_turn":0,"canon_version":2,"source_id":"preset-npc-dialogue","source_locator":"backend/content/npc_dialogue.py#menmesvento_ask_record","epistemic_status":"confirmed","keywords":["古卷","冊子","記錄","名字","往事","能力","危險","觸碰"]}
